  ('page_list', 'pages', 650, 'multiselect', 'Welche Seiten braucht Ihre Website?', 'What pages does your site need?', 'Wählen Sie aus der Liste oder tippen Sie eine eigene Seite ein. Ihre Leistungen von oben stehen auch in der Liste, falls eine davon eine eigene Seite bekommen soll. Rechtsseiten, die 404-Seite und die Danke-Seite sind immer dabei und zählen nicht mit.', 'Pick from the list or type a page of your own. Your services from above are in the list too, in case one should get a page of its own. Legal pages, the 404 page and the thank you page are always included and do not count towards your total.', 'Seite suchen oder eintippen', 'Search or type a page name', true, false, false, '[{"value":"home","label_de":"Startseite","label_en":"Home"},{"value":"about","label_de":"Über uns","label_en":"About us"},{"value":"services","label_de":"Leistungen","label_en":"Services"},{"value":"how_we_work","label_de":"So arbeiten wir","label_en":"How we work"},{"value":"team","label_de":"Team","label_en":"Team"},{"value":"work","label_de":"Referenzen","label_en":"Our work"},{"value":"testimonials","label_de":"Kundenstimmen","label_en":"Testimonials"},{"value":"prices","label_de":"Preise","label_en":"Prices"},{"value":"booking","label_de":"Termin buchen","label_en":"Book an appointment"},{"value":"classes","label_de":"Kurse","label_en":"Classes"},{"value":"timetable","label_de":"Stundenplan","label_en":"Timetable"},{"value":"events","label_de":"Veranstaltungen","label_en":"Events"},{"value":"shop","label_de":"Shop","label_en":"Shop"},{"value":"gallery","label_de":"Galerie","label_en":"Gallery"},{"value":"blog","label_de":"Blog","label_en":"Blog"},{"value":"news","label_de":"Aktuelles","label_en":"News"},{"value":"faq","label_de":"Häufige Fragen","label_en":"FAQ"},{"value":"downloads","label_de":"Downloads","label_en":"Downloads"},{"value":"careers","label_de":"Karriere","label_en":"Careers"},{"value":"press","label_de":"Presse","label_en":"Press"},{"value":"partners","label_